  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "Existing evidence is sparse: only config_001 (RNA-only, single-profile PCA) has been run, with modest accuracy 0.485 and F1 0.464, so it is still unclear whether image features carry useful signal. config_010 tests an image-only, single-profile ResNet50 baseline, isolating the image modality/representation without introducing fusion, multiprofile aggregation, or a new RNA encoder. This is the best next use of budget because it establishes a second unimodal anchor, clarifies whether multimodal fusion is worth pursuing, and avoids assuming that adding modalities or complexity will help."
}

